---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import ImageToolGrid from '../components/ImageToolGrid.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Free Online Image Tools — Batch Resize, Rename, Metadata & More | ConvertAnyFile" description="Private browser-based image tools for resizing, compressing, rotating, cropping, blurring, renaming, metadata cleanup and manual object or watermark repair.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="site-container hero-inner"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Image Tools</span></div><span class="eyebrow">Free Online Image Tools</span><h1>Private image edits that run in your browser.</h1><p>Resize, compress, rotate, crop, blur, rename, strip metadata or repair small visible selections without sending source images to an image-processing API. Batch tools share one queue and support shared or per-image workflows where they make sense.</p></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section"><div class="site-container"><div class="section-heading wide"><span class="section-kicker">Image Tools</span><h2>Choose a focused tool, then keep a familiar batch workflow.</h2><p>Core transforms, Bulk Rename, Remove Image Metadata and Remove Object are available as preview tools. Remove Watermark and the focused Gemini Watermark Remover continue on the same platform foundation.</p></div><ImageToolGrid /></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section white"><div class="site-container"><div class="content-intro-grid"><div><span class="section-kicker">Shared or individual</span><h2>Apply one setup to the batch, or customize exceptions.</h2><p>Start in Apply to all for repeated work. Switch to Edit individually when a specific image needs different dimensions, quality, orientation, crop, blur region, clean-output format, filename or manual mask placement.</p></div><div class="content-summary-card"><strong>Local by design</strong><p>Image decoding, preview, processing, ZIP creation and downloads happen in your browser. Bulk Rename does not decode or re-encode image bytes at all.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="content-wide-section"><div class="site-container"><div class="section-heading wide"><span class="section-kicker">Phase 4 preview</span><h2>Utility tools and the advanced mask canvas are now part of the platform.</h2><p>Bulk Rename preserves original image bytes while changing filenames. Remove Image Metadata creates new pixel-only copies without copying EXIF/GPS/software tags. Remove Object reuses local repair with zoom, pan, mask padding and feather controls.</p></div><div class="callout"><strong>Still planned</strong><p>Remove Background remains separate because reliable subject segmentation needs a separately validated engine rather than the local repair canvas.</p></div></div></section>
</SiteLayout>
